---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Dave Thackeray — The Dirty Secret Nobody Says in the Boardroom">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="speaker-hero">
    <p class="hero-label">Keynote Speaker • Podcast Host • The Voice You Can't Miss</p>
    
    <h1>The Dirty Secret Nobody Says in the Boardroom</h1>
    
    <div class="hero-stat">90%</div>
    
    <p class="hero-sub">
      of strategies fail to launch.<br>
      Not because the plan was wrong.<br>
      <strong>Because there was no one left to do the work.</strong>
    </p>
    
    <p class="hero-tagline">
      Dave Thackeray reveals why smart companies get stuck — and what the 12% who succeed do differently.
    </p>
    
    <p class="hero-role">30 years in journalism, strategy & coaching. 680+ leaders helped find clarity.</p>
    
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="#book" class="cta-primary">Book Dave for Your Conference</a>
      <a href="#podcast" class="cta-secondary">Book Dave for Your Podcast</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Truth -->
  <section class="section truth-section">
    <p class="section-label">The Research Nobody Wants to Hear</p>
    <h2>Strategy is a commodity. Execution is the crisis.</h2>
    
    <div class="truth-grid">
      <div class="truth-card">
        <div class="truth-stat">40%</div>
        <div class="truth-text">
          <h3>of strategy value is lost to execution failure</h3>
          <p>— Bain & Company / Harvard Business Review</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="truth-card">
        <div class="truth-stat">67%</div>
        <div class="truth-text">
          <h3>of well-formulated strategies fail to launch</h3>
          <p>— Harvard Business Review</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="truth-card">
        <div class="truth-stat">#1</div>
        <div class="truth-text">
          <h3>barrier to reinvention: the strategy-execution gap</h3>
          <p>— Project Management Institute, 2025</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Dave Reveals -->
  <section class="section">
    <p class="section-label">What Dave Reveals On Stage</p>
    <h2>Your audience will finally understand why they've been stuck — and leave with the one shift that creates momentum</h2>
    
    <div class="topics-grid">
      <div class="topic-card">
        <p class="topic-type">🔥 Keynote (45-60 min)</p>
        <h3 class="topic-title">The 90% Reality</h3>
        <p class="topic-hook">Why most strategies fail — and it's not what you think. The research-backed truth about the execution crisis.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-card">
        <p class="topic-type">💀 Wake-Up Call</p>
        <h3 class="topic-title">Why Your Best People Are Your Biggest Bottleneck</h3>
        <p class="topic-hook">The counterintuitive reason high-performers kill transformation — and the "Special Projects" fix.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-card">
        <p class="topic-type">🎯 Framework</p>
        <h3 class="topic-title">The Problem Behind the Problem</h3>
        <p class="topic-hook">A framework for finding the real issue when everything looks like a symptom and nothing looks like a cause.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-card">
        <p class="topic-type">⚡ Tactical</p>
        <h3 class="topic-title">Why I Shipped 12 AI Products While Everyone Else Was "Strategising"</h3>
        <p class="topic-hook">The Weekend Shipping method. No frameworks. No sprints. Just output.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-card">
        <p class="topic-type">🧠 Methodology</p>
        <h3 class="topic-title">Signal from Noise</h3>
        <p class="topic-hook">The journalist's framework I use to cut through chaos and find the story that matters.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-card">
        <p class="topic-type">🎭 Energy Hack</p>
        <h3 class="topic-title">The Energy That Survives the Screen</h3>
        <p class="topic-hook">680+ recommendations cite my "contagious enthusiasm." I'll show your audience exactly how to transmit energy anywhere.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What People Say -->
  <section class="section">
    <p class="section-label">What People Say</p>
    <h2>"Contagious energy" and practical ideas that actually work</h2>
    
    <div class="testimonials">
      <div class="testimonial">
        <blockquote>"If you have a content problem and no-one else can help and if you can find him... then you need to hire Dave Thackeray."</blockquote>
        <cite>— Clare Newman, Business Manager, Michael Page</cite>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial">
        <blockquote>"Dave is a mountain of practical and valuable ideas. The volume and practicality of his ideas... He's a machine!"</blockquote>
        <cite>— Mary Obi, Vet Doctor & Entrepreneur</cite>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial">
        <blockquote>"He's a connector of dots — and if everyone could connect dots the way he does we would all live in a utopian society."</blockquote>
        <cite>— Haleh Moravej, Manchester Met</cite>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial">
        <blockquote>"For me, it was like therapy. Books, movies, and tips for life."</blockquote>
        <cite>— Angelica Buitrago, Senior UX Designer</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Proof -->
  <section class="proof-section">
    <div class="proof-grid">
      <div class="proof-item">
        <h3>12</h3>
        <p>AI products shipped in 4 months</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <h3>680+</h3>
        <p>recommendations citing energy & ideas</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <h3>30</h3>
        <p>years making the complex simple</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <h3>100%</h3>
        <p>focus on action, not just insight</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Podcast Section -->
  <section class="section" id="podcast">
    <p class="section-label">Podcast Hosts</p>
    <h2>Topics that deliver ratings — and takeaways your audience will actually use</h2>
    
    <p class="podcast-intro">
      I bring energy, research-backed insights, and stories that land. No fluff. No theory. Pure value that makes your listeners hit "share."
    </p>
    
    <div class="podcast-cta-box">
      <p><strong>Ready to book?</strong> I'm available for 30-60 minute conversations on the execution crisis, AI shipping, or the psychology of stuck leaders.</p>
      <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com?subject=Podcast%20Guest%20Inquiry" class="cta-primary">Email Dave</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section" id="book">
    <h2>Get Dave on your stage</h2>
    <p>Your audience deserves the wake-up call. And the relief of finally understanding why they've been stuck.</p>
    
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com?subject=Speaking%20Inquiry" class="cta-primary">Email Dave Directly</a>
      <a href="#recommend" class="cta-secondary">Recommend Dave to Your Conference</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Recommend Email Template -->
  <section class="section" id="recommend">
    <p class="section-label">Want to Recommend Dave?</p>
    <h2>Send this to your conference organiser</h2>
    
    <div class="email-template">
      <p class="subject">Subject: Speaker Recommendation: Dave Thackeray — "The 90% Reality"</p>
      
      <p>Hi [Organiser Name],</p>
      <br>
      <p>I wanted to recommend a speaker for [Conference Name]: <strong>Dave Thackeray</strong>.</p>
      <br>
      <p>Dave has a talk called <strong>"The 90% Reality"</strong> — revealing why 90% of strategies fail to launch, based on research from Bain, McKinsey, and Stanford. But he doesn't just present data. He makes it <em>actionable</em>.</p>
      <br>
      <p>His core message: The reason most change initiatives fail isn't strategy or budget — it's that companies try to run transformation with "star players" who are already drowning in day-to-day work. He reveals what the 12% who succeed do differently.</p>
      <br>
      <p><strong>Why Dave?</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>30 years in journalism, strategy, and coaching — he makes the complex simple</li>
        <li>680+ written recommendations citing his "contagious energy"</li>
        <li>He's shipped 12 AI products in 4 months — he doesn't just talk, he builds</li>
        <li>His promise: "Your audience will finally understand why they've been stuck"</li>
      </ul>
      <br>
      <p>Website: <a href="https://wordandmouth.com">wordandmouth.com</a> | Email: <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com">dave@wordandmouth.com</a></p>
      <br>
      <p>I genuinely think he'd be one of the most memorable speakers on the programme.</p>
      <br>
      <p>Let me know if you'd like an intro.</p>
      <br>
      <p>[Your Name]</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .speaker-hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .hero-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .speaker-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .hero-stat {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #ccc;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
  }
  
  .hero-sub strong { color: #fff; }
  
  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .hero-role {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  
  /* Section */
  .section {
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .section h2 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  /* Truth Section */
  .truth-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,107,53,0.05) 50%, transparent 100%);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
  }
  
  .truth-section h2,
  .truth-section .section-label,
  .truth-grid {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  
  .truth-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  
  .truth-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  
  .truth-stat {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    min-width: 80px;
  }
  
  .truth-text h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .truth-text p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  
  /* Topics */
  .topics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  
  .topic-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .topic-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  
  .topic-type {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .topic-title {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .topic-hook {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  /* Testimonials */
  .testimonials {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  
  .testimonial {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,107,53,0.05) 0%, transparent 100%);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }
  
  .testimonial blockquote {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ddd;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .testimonial cite {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  /* Proof */
  .proof-section {
    background: #111;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }
  
  .proof-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .proof-item h3 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .proof-item p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  /* Podcast */
  .podcast-intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .podcast-cta-box {
    background: rgba(255,107,53,0.05);
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .podcast-cta-box p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  /* CTA Section */
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,107,53,0.08) 100%);
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  /* Email Template */
  .email-template {
    background: #0f0f0f;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #ccc;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  
  .email-template .subject {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .email-template ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .email-template a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
